flowchart TD
    T[Manual or daily trigger] --> C[WF-00 Prepare context and resolve pipeline run]
    C --> I[(PostgreSQL atomic run claim)]
    I -->|Already claimed| S[Skip repeated run]
    I -->|Acquired| D[WF-01 Data Quality Monitor]
    D --> Q{Complete and healthy?}
    Q -->|Healthy| H[Record healthy outcome]
    Q -->|Incident| A[WF-02 SQL Analytics Agent]
    A --> R{Dry run?}
    R -->|Yes| DR[Record dry-run report; skip remediation]
    R -->|No| RCA[WF-03 Evidence and RCA]
    RCA --> CR[Critic and revision gate]
    CR --> P{Human approval}
    P -->|Approved| W[Quarantine duplicate and audit]
    P -->|Rejected| REJ[Log rejection]
    W --> O[Final incident report]
    REJ --> O
    H --> N[Gmail notifications when applicable]
    DR --> N
    O --> N
    D -. Child error .-> E[Failure report, ledger and Gmail alert]
    A -. Child error .-> E
    RCA -. Child error .-> E
    C -. Unhandled production error .-> EH[Supporting Error Trigger handler]
